 ## Rules for agents
 
 - To add a component: a type in `src/model/model.ts`, a draw file in `src/components/`,
-  a case in `src/engine/render.ts`, an inspector section, and a built-in preset.
+  a case in `src/engine/render.ts`, an inspector section, and a built-in preset recipe.
+- To add a preset: a JSON recipe in `presets/built-in/` combining traits; add a trait in
+  `src/traits/` only when no existing one fits.
 - Never draw with wall-clock time: everything takes `t` (seconds within the loop) so exports
   are deterministic.
 - Use pnpm, never npm or yarn.
